# Packed Addressables and temporary Android assets
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# Project-specific
/Assets/Imported/ShaderWeaver/
/Assets/Imported/ShaderWeaver.meta

# Python bytecode from Tools/
__pycache__/
